{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_01",
      "hash": "cfeec5c10668e430",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要我给你一些\\n挑战道馆馆主时的建议吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_02",
      "hash": "cfeec8c10668e949",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好嘞！\\n那么，赶紧的……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_03",
      "hash": "cfeec7c10668e796",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对战时\\n第一个上场的宝可梦……\\r\\n就是同行宝可梦列表的\\r\\n左上方的那只了！\\c\\n只要改变列表里的顺序，\\n有时也能对自己有利！\\r\\n你不妨试试看！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_04",
      "hash": "cfeecac10668ecaf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你不用客气！\\n那咱们赶紧的……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_gym_05",
      "hash": "cfeec9c10668eafc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你可真是名不虚传！\\n就是这个势头！\\r\\n朝着宝可梦冠军进发吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_statue_01",
      "hash": "0af8263e63820107",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市宝可梦道馆\\n小刚认证训练家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003gym01_statue_02",
      "hash": "0af8273e638202ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "深灰市宝可梦道馆\\n小刚认证训练家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]　[VAR TRNAME(0000)]"
    }
  ],
